test: cleanup of unused EBUILD and DIST entries
Ensures that missing .ebuilds and unreferenced DIST files are removed from the manifest.

-- input/Manifest --
DIST test-1.0.tar.gz 1024 SHA256 abc
DIST unused-1.0.tar.gz 2048 SHA256 def
EBUILD test-1.0.ebuild 512 SHA256 ghi
EBUILD unused-1.0.ebuild 512 SHA256 jkl
-- input/test-1.0.ebuild --
SRC_URI="https://example.com/test-1.0.tar.gz"
-- expected/Manifest --
DIST test-1.0.tar.gz 1024 SHA256 abc
EBUILD test-1.0.ebuild 512 SHA256 ghi
